      "title": "RTP: Fix some memleaks",
      "message": "RTP: Fix some memleaks\n\nIn the tap, the stream ID allocated on the stack just needs a shallow\ncopy of the addresses. It only needs a deep copy when being added as a\nnew entry to the list.\n\nRestore the memleak fix from e76ca2d3cb005d9276c953a14e63523a21cdb8dc\nthat was accidentally removed by 1b4b5e59e9afbf9a83e647755ed6b3a2f344464d\n",
